__pycache__/
node_modules/
# Personal editor state stays out, but launch.json is the documented F5 dev
# workflow (CONTRIBUTING.md) and has to be in the repo for it to work on a clone.
# Note the `.vscode/*` glob: with `.vscode/` git never descends into the folder, so
# a negation for a file inside it would be ignored.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
*.vsix
